Package: micutoff
Title: Pool First or Optimize First? Cutoffs from Multiply Imputed Biomarker Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Grimes", , "tyler.grimes@unf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("FILL", "second author", role = "aut"))
Description: A research compendium: the functions, tests, analysis scripts,
    results, and manuscript of one project run with the research workflow,
    on whether to pool the accuracy curves or the optimal cutoffs across
    multiply imputed biomarker data.
